Now let's think carefully about the actual upstream implementation. Maybe I can reconstruct from the CSS hooks and class naming conventions:

`drag_and_drop.css`:
```css
@layer components {
  .drag-and-drop__dragged-item {
    box-shadow: none;
    filter: grayscale(1) brightness(0.97);
    opacity: 0.6;
    outline: 2px dashed var(--color-selected-dark);
